      "text": "Exercise · camera preview + 3 gestures; vary light, distance, occlusion.\nDeliverable · gesture module with visible camera state and stop control.\nGate · precision/recall ≥0.90 on declared test set; false triggers measured.\nThis track does not block V0.4 offline voice.",
