      "created": 1793537685440,
      "text": "Treat transcripts, images, model output, and phone requests as untrusted. Allowlisted tools only; validate arguments; require approval for consequential actions.\nVisible microphone/camera state · no raw media saved by default · no public unauthenticated API · no arbitrary shell · offline core stays usable.",
      "originalText": "Treat transcripts, images, model output, and phone requests as untrusted. Allowlisted tools only; validate arguments; require approval for consequential actions.\nVisible microphone/camera state · no raw media saved by default · no public unauthenticated API · no arbitrary shell · offline core stays usable.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
